   "alt": "Looking up into the trapeze rig of the big top, red-and-white striped canvas criss-crossed with ropes, rope ladders and a safety net, painted in ink and gouache. High up a baker on a swing tosses buns, two baby elephants bounce in the strong net and a clown dives bravely towards a tub of custard. In mid-air a strongwoman holds a ladder firmly while an acrobat balances on top, a bear juggles on a unicycle along the tightrope, a clown tumbles as his stilts smash to pieces, a lion holds up a hoop impatiently and a swimmer glides along a water tank. On the sawdust a shy lion cub peeks from a red curtain, a poodle follows the ringmaster step for step, a jolly man arranges flowers, a man leaps madly in front of a painted garden folly, a dog sits loyally looking up, a man offers a girl a rose by a warm stove and a carpenter carves a wooden swan. The red-curtained doorway on the left leads back to the ring.",
