   "alt": "A grand parade seen from the balcony of the big top, red-and-white striped canvas hung with bunting, painted in ink and gouache: one long line winds across the sawdust. At the back a snowman shivers dreadfully on a little float, a cat in a striped deli apron steadies a tower of eggs and the Snow Queen glares coldly from her sleigh at a little man. A trumpeter plays horribly out of tune while two seals cover their ears, a man waters a plant under a glass dome uselessly, a man pushes a huge boulder up a ramp, a clown hands a lost wallet back to a smiling lady and a gentleman tips his top hat. A rude man shoves another, an acrobat tests a trapeze with one toe and a hippo in a pink tutu tiptoes along a low tightrope. At the front a penguin sits solemnly beside a golden trophy, a ringmaster frowns at a monkey holding his top hat, a clown with half his wig gone looks in a mirror and a ringmaster measures a seal with a ruler. The red-curtained doorway on the left leads back to the ring.",
