   "alt": "The magic show inside the big top, seen from the sawdust in front of a round wooden stage with blue star-spangled curtains under red-and-white striped canvas, painted in ink and gouache. On stage under the spotlights: a rabbit hopping into a magician's top hat, an easy-going strongman holding up a grand piano on one finger, two white poodles bowing in turn in the spotlight, a cat yawning wide open, a lion whose fake mane slips to reveal a tabby cat, a cat carefully gripping a trapeze bar and a monkey in a lab coat measuring a trampoline. On the sawdust: clowns tumbling pell-mell out of a tiny red car, a clown slipping on banana peels, a beach ball bouncing off the stage to bop a clown on the nose, a clown tripping over his own big shoe on purpose, a seal working through a crate of balls, a clown handing out free balloons while a giraffe helps itself, a pig filling a piggy bank with coins and an ant sweeping sawdust with a tiny broom. The red-curtained doorway on the left leads back to the ring; a magician's draped prop table and a stack of benches stand on the right. On the right, a magician in a top hat shows off an empty golden birdcage while secretly lifting the blue tablecloth, where a white dove hides in a hidden drawer.",
