   "alt": "A backstage practice ring inside the big top seen from high above, red-and-white striped canvas walls, lanterns and sawdust, painted in ink and gouache, where surprises go off everywhere at once. At the back a bear in a striped shirt juggles clubs with his sandwich flying among them, a baker carries a steaming loaf, a magician snaps his fingers as a dove vanishes in white mist, an elephant in a pink tutu blinks under a hanging lamp and a boy drives a toy train along parallel rails. In the middle three acrobats leap at the same moment, a cannon fires with a puff beside a clown clutching popcorn, a little audience dances a conga round two drums, a giant beetroot pops up and Sue jumps a mile, and a snowman serenades a dewy pear on his guitar. In front a pony squeezes between hay bales, a keeper rushes a bucket of fish to a hungry tiger, a tightrope walker on a low rope stares ahead, a confetti cannon goes off early over a startled clown and a cracked taped-up tent pole leans on an open umbrella. A red-curtained wooden doorway on the left leads back to the ring; a jack-in-the-box and a pile of gift boxes fill the right.",
